{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24120","headline":"十二月二十三日作兼呈晦叔 · 白居易","name":"十二月二十三日作兼呈晦叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"案头历日虽未尽，向後唯残六七行。\n牀下酒瓶虽不满，犹应醉得两三场。\n病身不许依年老，拙宦虚教逐日忙。\n闻健偷闲且勤饮，一杯之外莫思量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}